SURFACE SHAPE (vs the AINLDriveSearch 0032 analog)
--------------------------------------------------
AINLSearch is a prompt-input streaming AI surface: withAiFeature('nl-search') → AIFeatureCard
(title + cyan Helix badge + description + a prompt inputSlot Textarea + the universal "Ask
Helix"/"Helix is thinking…" action) → AiOutputPanel, driven by useAiStream ({ url:
'/ai/search/query', body: { prompt }, onEvent: () => {} }). It is the cross-entity sibling of
AINLDriveSearch (0032): same composition, no vehicle scope, no MaxQuestionChars cap — its only
POST field is the free-form `prompt` and the button gate is purely `canStart =
prompt.trim().length > 0` (faithful to the web source, which sets no maxLength and no aria-label
on the Textarea). Verified the feature id + route exist:
