    uiTestIds ["ai-feature-nl-search-root"].
  • backend strategy: internal/ai/strategies/nl-search/strategy.go L70 `const FeatureID =
    "nl-search"`.
  • backend route: internal/api/ai_routes.go L226 `r.Post("/search/query", g.Wrap("nl-search",
    searchHandler))` → POST /api/v1/ai/search/query (parallel to the canonical /search typed
    handler; matches the web `useAiStream` url '/ai/search/query').

